le sequence of operations:</p><p></p><ol> <li> decrement the first two elements $$$\\to [0,1,1]$$$; </li><li> decrement the last two elements $$$\\to [0,0,0]$$$. </li></ol><p></p><p>In the third sample the answer is <span class="tex-font-style-tt">NO</span>.</p>'}
